OL,3,GNEWSA'Fascinating' rare beetle found in
OL,4,AWales again after 60 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rare species of beetle has been found
OL,7,Fin Pembrokeshire after being missing
OL,8,Ffrom Wales for 60 years.
OL,10,FThe Short-Necked Oil Beetle are
OL,11,Fdependent on solitary bees for its
OL,12,Flifecycle and need a particular habitat
OL,13,Fto survive, with thick vegetation for
OL,14,Fshelter and dense flower coverage both
OL,15,Fessential.
OL,17,FThey were not reported in the UK for
OL,18,Falmost 60 years after 1948 as habitat
OL,19,Floss brought the species to the brink
OL,20,Fof extinction.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
